SUMMARY:Opening To Spirit: 7-Week Mediumship Mentorship (**by application 
 only**)
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nINFO & APPLICATION: [https://www.robynmic
 helle.co/openingtospirit](https://www.robynmichelle.co/openingtospirit)\n\
 n#### **Build a strong foundation in evidential mediumship - so you can tr
 ust your connection with Spirit and deliver clear\, evidence-based message
 s with confidence.**\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\nYou don’t hav
 e to be “born with it” to be a medium. Mediumship is a natural human a
 bility - and with the right guidance and practice\, it can absolutely be d
 eveloped. In this seven-week mentorship\, you’ll build a strong foundati
 on in mediumship so you can connect with Spirit consistently and share wha
 t you receive with clarity and confidence.\n\nWe’ll focus on **evidentia
 l mediumship**\, learning your unique way of receiving **verifiable detail
 s** from Spirit that validate their presence and bring real comfort. Along
 side skill-building and practice\, we’ll integrate **grounding\, boundar
 ies\, and nervous system support** so you can open safely and trust what y
 ou’re receiving.\n\nThis mentorship journey is open to all levels\, and 
 especially supportive if you’re new to mediumship or if still building c
 onfidence in your skills. **Enrollment is limited to** **8 participants**\
 , so you’ll receive personalized guidance and meaningful practice in a w
 arm\, supportive group.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**This is a 7-week commitment. E
 ach session builds on the last.**\nSessions are held live on Zoom with a s
 mall group. Participation is encouraged\, and recordings of the teaching p
 ortions will be available if you need to miss a session.\n\n***\n\n**What 
 Participants Are Saying...**\n\n*"Taking this mediumship mentorship has be
 en a **deeply transformative experience**... The way Robyn guides the spac
 e is both grounded and expansive - honoring the mystery while offering pra
 ctical tools to strengthen intuitive connection. We learned powerful techn
 iques\, yet there was always room for exploration\, vulnerability\, and au
 thentic expression. I found myself opening to realms of connection I had o
 nly glimpsed before\, and I now move with a **greater sense of trust in my
  inner knowing and the unseen support all around us**. I’m leaving with 
 more confidence\, clarity\, and reverence for the work."*\n\\-\\- Emma W\\
 .\n\n*“If you’re thinking about joining\, know that Robyn creates a sp
 ace where you not only learn mediumship but also truly grow in confidence.
  She has a way of guiding you step by step\, so you come out feeling not j
 ust prepared but genuinely **empowered to trust yourself and your abilitie
 s**. By the end\, you’ll see real shifts in how you view your own potent
 ial\, and you’ll be excited about the journey ahead!”*\n\\-\\- Nicole 
 E\\.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n***If you’ve been curious about Spiri
 t communication and want to approach it in a way that’s grounded\, suppo
 rtive\, and respectful of your nervous system\, you’re warmly welcome he
 re.***\n\nINFO & APPLICATION: [https://www.robynmichelle.co/openingtospiri
 t](https://www.robynmichelle.co/openingtospirit)
