SUMMARY:New Moon Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**This session will be conducted virtuall
 y via Zoom.**\n\n**The new moon marks the beginning of a new lunar month\,
  this period serves as an opportunity for renewal and is considered an app
 ropriate time to reflect on intentions and initiate new projects\, both li
 teral and metaphorical.**\n\n**During this session\, participants are enco
 uraged to engage in practices of renewal\, reflection\, and intention-sett
 ing. The focus will be on aligning with seasonal\, solar\, and lunar energ
 ies to identify and articulate personal goals for the forthcoming cycle.**
 \n**Attendees are advised to prepare by writing down their intentions and 
 aspirations prior to the session\, without self-editing or concern for the
  practicalities of realization.**\n**The session will begin with a guided 
 breathing exercise designed to enhance relaxation and unify group energy. 
 I will draw a few tarot and oracle cards to aid in clarifying intentions a
 nd focusing on desired outcomes.**\n\n**A meditation component will facili
 tate deep relaxation and support individual healing processes. Participant
 s are recommended to have their crystals available\, as part of the progra
 m involves clearing stagnant or negative energies from these items.**\n**A
 dditionally\, there will be at least one guided Shamanic journey—a medit
 ative exercise aimed at intention exploration—providing participants wit
 h the opportunity to connect with their spirit guides and or spirit animal
 s.**\n\n**We look forward to your participation. Let me know if you have a
 ny questions or intentions that you would like to share.**\n**Love and Lig
 ht\,**\n**Shaman Phil**
