 his period serves as an opportunity for renewal and is considered an appro
 priate time to reflect on intentions and initiate new projects\, both lite
 ral and metaphorical.**\n**During this shamanic session\, you are encourag
 ed to engage in practices of renewal\, reflection\, and intention-setting.
  The focus will be on aligning with seasonal\, solar\, and lunar energies 
 to identify and articulate personal goals for the forthcoming cycle.**\n**
 Attendees are advised to prepare by writing down their intentions and aspi
 rations prior to the session\, without self-editing or concern for the pra
 cticalities of realization.**\n**The session will begin with a guided brea
 thing exercise designed to enhance relaxation and unify group energy. I wi
 ll draw a few tarot and oracle cards to aid in clarifying intentions and f
 ocusing on desired outcomes.**\n**A meditation component will facilitate d
 eep relaxation and support individual healing processes. Participants are 
 recommended to have their crystals available\, as part of the program invo
 lves clearing stagnant or negative energies from these items.**\n**Additio
 nally\, there will be at least one guided Shamanic journey—a meditative 
